{"code":"331920","name":"셀레믹스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"생물공학","sector_desc":"바이오 의약품·플랫폼 기술 개발. 임상·기술이전 뉴스에 변동성이 매우 큰 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 2010년 설립된 기초 의약물질 및 생물학적 제제 제조업체로, 2020년 코스닥시장에 상장한 벤처기업임. NGS 기반 유전자분석 기술플랫폼기업으로, 차세대 클로닝 기술을 바탕으로 Target Capture Kit와 BTSeq 솔루션을 생산·판매하며, 병원, 제약사, 연구소 등에 진단·신약개발 소재를 공급하고 있음. BT-NT-IT 융합 기술을 통해 분자클로닝의 저비용, 대량고속 수요 대응에 주력하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":8980.0,"open":9500.0,"high":9500.0,"low":8230.0,"volume":142727,"amount":1281688460.0,"ret_1d":-6.3608,"gap":-0.9385,"range_pct":14.1425,"ret_5":-11.4398,"ret_20":-17.0822,"ret_60":-3.3369,"ret_120":-49.7763,"ret_250":199.8331,"ma20":10179.5,"ma60":10795.8333,"ma120":12049.25,"ma200":10153.125,"close_vs_ma200":-11.5543,"close_vs_ma60":-16.8198,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":31.0149,"r2_60":0.0152,"slope_120":-58.2594,"r2_120":0.3832,"slope_250":558.3586,"r2_250":0.6374,"high52":19840.0,"low52":2535.0,"pos_52w":37.2436,"dd_52w":-54.7379,"mdd_1y":-53.956,"atr14_pct":10.1257,"vol_ann_60":101.3413,"vol_avg20":59350.05,"vol_ratio20":2.4048,"vr5":1.0002,"vr20":0.417,"amount_avg5":652931444.0,"amount_avg20":602671965.5,"amount_avg60":770084952.1667,"obv_chg20":-21.2932,"turnover_20":10.6157,"pv_eff_20":-1.6091,"rsi14":33.5156,"frgn_net_5":34005.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.3041,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.3041,"frgn_net_20":38447.0,"inst_net_20":1918.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.3438,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0172,"smart_net_20_pct":0.361,"frgn_net_60":3008.0,"inst_net_60":32988.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0269,"inst_net_60_pct":0.295,"smart_net_60_pct":0.3219,"frgn_net_120":-14250.0,"inst_net_120":204565.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1274,"inst_net_120_pct":1.8295,"smart_net_120_pct":1.702,"foreign_ratio":1.38,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.02,"smart_buy_streak":4,"op_income_q":-9.0,"op_margin_q":-64.2857,"op_qoq":35.7143,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":30.7692,"rev_yoy":27.2727,"op_trend_4q":-3.0769,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-51.97,"debt_ratio":60.48,"